<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Attu o Ufilipi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Iwarakha i Napaolo wa attu o Ufilipi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Attu o Ufilipi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ufil</para>
  <para style="mt2">Iwarakha i Napaolo wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Attu o Ufilipi</para>
  <para style="imt">Malhove o uholhelha</para>
  <para style="ip">Napaolo yaalhempe iwarakha wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o Ufilipi iyaakha yo 61 baada yo uyaria wa Kuristo, ikatema Napaolo vaari aya anattukiye (nlhako wo 1:13), veekinaka vaari aya Urumi. Iwarakha iyo yaalhepiye wa nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo yaakhalha iwani yo Ufilipi. Ninowooria tho waachuwelha attu o Ufilipi mwi ikitabu yo Mitheko cha akarumiya. Iwani yo Ufilipi yaari iwani yulhupalhe mwi ilhapo yo Umakedoniya. Ni uwo chiicho wahaawo nlhoko wo upachera uchokholhiya Umakedoniya. Napaolo ni Nasila yaari attu yaachokholhinhe nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo vamoka, tho ni uttukiya uhiyu mmoka vaari aya wowo (Mitk nlhako wo 16).</para>
  <para style="ip">Napaolo vaalhepa aya ilha iwarakha ilha, yaari ni nrima mwinchi wo waaruma ulhepa ilha iwarakha ilha. Tho, wo nenno nipesha nno, ahaashukuru attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo wo izawadi chaakuminhe aya veewilhe aya wiira Napaolo yaari muuttukiyani, (nlhako wo 4:10-19). Tho, ahaahimiachera yayo manyaattu ayo mwaha wo makhalhelho yaakhalha aya muuttukiyani. Ahaathanlha Natimotheo ni Naepafrodito ni waachuwelhiha wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo (nlhako wo 2:19-30) wiira apocheriye ni wiiwelhelhiya rata, vanohalha aya uvara ntheko wo waaholhelha attu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Chiri nhina.</para>
  <para style="io">Napaolo anochokholha iwarakha aya wo waashikuria attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o Ufilipi (nlhako wo 1:1-2).</para>
  <para style="io">Tho, anoohimiacha mwaha waapantte unaacha mitheko chaya (nlhako wo 1:3-2:30).</para>
  <para style="io">Anowaavaha ikano chinothananiya aya attu ukhalha makhalhelho a attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo (nlhako wo 3:1-4:9).</para>
  <para style="io">Napaolo anomalhiha wo waashukuru attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o Ufilipi wo izawadi chaarweehelhiye aya ni waavaha isalamu (nlhako wo 4:10-23).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mii Paolo ni Timotheo namitheko a Yesu Kuristo, ninoolhepa iwarakha iwe uwaninyu mwaatti attu a Nlhuku nlhutanne ni Kuristo Yesu nri Ufilipi vamoka ni aholhelhi ni attu anaakaviha ushunga nlhoko wa attu a Nlhuku. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kinoulhapelhelhani nnema ni mpuha ukhuma wa Nlhuku Athumwanihu ni Athithi Yesu Kuristo.</para>
  <para style="s">Napaolo anowaalhapelhelha attu a Nlhuku o Ufilipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kinonshukuru Nlhuku aka kila ikatema vanowupuwelhaakani mwaatti, <verse number="4" style="v"/>ni kila vanoulhapelhelhakani mwaatti onkhaye, kinolhepelha wo uteelhiya munrimani, <verse number="5" style="v"/>wo nlhatu no ukhalha nlhoko mmoka ni mii uvara ntheko wo uhimiacha Malhove Orera ukhuma nihuku no upachera nne mpaka lhelho nna va. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Paahi, mii kihochuwelha we ikekhiaye wiira Nlhuku chokhonlhe ulha ntheko woombone uwaninyu ulha phi nowa aamalhihera nihuku no uhokolhia Kuristo Yesu nne.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Phi nrera aya irusho chaka chuwuupuwelheni chiicho, kwaani mwaatti nri munrimani mwaka. Ukhalhawaya mwaatti onkhaye va nhokikaviha munnemani mukivanhe awe Nlhuku wo wiinanelha ni uhimiechesha Malhove Orera, vattukiye aka va ama vaari aka kihinattukiya. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya we ikekhiaye Nlhuku phi nohimiechesha ittu inoolhumacha aka, wo uttuna unokhuma munrimani mwa Yesu Kuristo ulhe, kiholhakelha chinene uwoonani mwaatti.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Cho phi nonlhapelha aka Nlhuku, uttuna winyu uthepeke wunchereria chinene vamoka ni uchuwelha ikeekhene wo irusho wo iphiro chonkhaye, <verse number="10" style="v"/>wiira nchuwelhe ittu yo ulhoka. Nkhalhe ni nrima ntakatifu wo uhikhalha ni nlhatu uriwoothe wo unanara mpaka nihuku no uhokolhia Kuristo nno. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vavawo ukumi inyu unocharihiya meetelho e ikekhia mmiholho wa Nlhuku anokhuma wa Yesu Kuristo mwanene wiira Nlhuku athimichiye ni utotopelhiya.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukhalha ukumi wo unkavihera Kuristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ashilhoko aka, kinothanana nchuwelhe wiira mwaha wonkhaye ukipantte mii, uhokaviha uwanelhiha Malhove Orera. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Paahi etu wo yoyo nlhatu uyo, manyaasikari onkhaye anolhitelhelha inupa ya amwene vamoka ni attu akina onkhaye o va, ahochuwelha wiira kittukiye wo nlhatu no urumiya ni Kuristo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya uttukiya waka uhaapanga attu enchi anaarumelhelha Athithi athepe ukhalha ni machiri o waakhulhuvelha Athithi chinene ni uhimiacha nlhove na Nlhuku wo uhoova ittu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>We ikekhiaye attu akina anohimiacha Nlhove na Kuristo wo nlhatu wo ihache ni uhilhoka nrima, nansho attu akina anonhimiacha wo nlhatu woombone. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yayo manyaattu ayo anonhimiacha wo uttuna ukhalhawaya ahochuwelha wiira Nlhuku hokivaha ulha ntheko wo winkelha Malhove Orera ulha. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nansho attu akina alhe anohimiacha Nlhove na Kuristo wo nlhatu wo wiishipa kuhii wo uteelhiya munrimani, yaanyiheraka wiira anokuncherera uhuva urina aka vattukiye aka va.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nansho yayo uwannyaka mii khave ittu. Wo iphiro choothe, ikhalhe wo nrima woombone ama wo ikekhiaye, Malhove Orera a Kuristo anoohimiachiya. Ni wo yoyo nlhatu uyo, mii phi nothepa aka uteelhiya nrima, <verse number="19" style="v"/>ukhalhawaya kihochuwelha wiira wo ulhapelha winyu ni ukavihereriya ni Iphumu ya Yesu Kuristo kinoohiyereriya. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mathananelho aka molhupalhe ni ukhulhuvelha waka uri woona wiira wo iphiro iriyoothe akinoolhiya muru munthekoni waka. Nansho kilhipeke nrima, kila ikatema, kichokholhaka vano, wiira mwiiruttuni waka mwonkhaye kinari nkumi ama kinakhwilhe Kuristo athimichiye. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya uwannyaka mii ukhalha nkumi phi unkaviha ntheko Kuristo ni ukhwa phi ifaida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nansho yakhalhaka wiira ukhalha nkumi phi ifaida yuulhupalhe yo munthekoni, paahi etu, akichuwenlhe inohalha aka uthanlha. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Alha melhi alha etu ahokivara. Kinoothanana chinene uthama kihiye ulha ukumi ulha kakhalhe ni Kuristo, ukhalhawaya phi ittu irii yoombone chinene, <verse number="24" style="v"/>nansho ukhalha nkumi wo nlhatu winyu mwaatti phi ittu yo lazima chinene. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ni mii kihochuwelha wiira kinoothepa ulhokelha vamoka ni inyu mwaatti onkhaye kuukaviheni mmwe mwaathepa uvarechesha ni uteelhiya nrima, <verse number="26" style="v"/>wiira vanohalha aka ukhalha ni inyu mwaatti vawo, mmwe mwaateelhiya chinene wo ulhutaana winyu ni Kuristo Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Paahi etu, meetelho inyu akhalheke thoko chinothananiya ni Malhove Orera a Kuristo, wiira kooriaka uwa ama kaahorieke, kiwe keewa wiira nheemelha rata wo nrima mmoka ni wo nnikwa mmoka wo wiinanelha nrima unowiihiya wo Malhove Orera. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nhoove attu anoovingani nansho mweemelheke rata. Yeyo phi ittu inooniha upotera waya, ni inyu mwaatti nnowa mwoopolhiya ukhalhawaya Nlhuku phi nouvaherani noopo. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya kila ntu Nlhuku hommaha imboote yo unkaviha Kuristo, kuhiwe wo unrumelhelha vekha ayaru nansho ni utwarushiya wo nlhatu wawe. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Vano nnowooria ukavihana ni mii ikhoto yo wiinanelha Malhove Orera mwonne inyu kaatakanaka katashi valhe. Ni iyo phi iyo inothepa aka waatakana mpaka nna thoko chineera inyu wo wiiwa.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Utwariha wiitimarikha wa Kuristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Chani ukhalha winyu nlhoko mmoka ni Kuristo unouvahani machiri? Chani uttuna wawe unouvahani mpuha uriwoothe? Chani nnoolhutaana ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku? Chani nhanaa nrima wo woonelhana ikiriri ni uchukulhelhana mwaashineneru? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Paahi etu nthepeke ukiteelhiha nrima wo ukhalha ni moopuwelho mamoka ni nrima mmoka wo uttunana ni nrima mmoka wo ulhakelha ittu imoka. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nhipange ittu iriyoothe wo nrima wo niwucho ama wo wiititihacha nansho mwiitimarikheke mwaashineneru, kila mmoka amwooneke nkhunanawe wiira phi ittu yoombone umpwaha mwanene. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kila ntu hilhohe mathananelho awe mwaneneru nansho alhoheke mathananelho a attu akina. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nkhalheke ni irusho thoko yolhe waarina awe Kuristo Yesu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yoyo thoko chiri awe wo machokholhelho aari Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q">nansho khaanyihenre wiira wo ukhalha thoko Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="q">phi ittu yo ukuruvalhelha,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>nansho wo uttuna wawe mwanene</para>
  <para style="q">ahohiya kila ittu yaarina awe,</para>
  <para style="q">nkeepanga ukhalha thoko namitheko.</para>
  <para style="q">Nkoonia ikhove awe thoko chinokhalha aya attu akina.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Tho aheetimarikha mpaka ukhwa</para>
  <para style="q">ukhwa vansalaabani.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Paahi etu Nlhuku ahomwiinulha uchulhu chinene</para>
  <para style="q">nkammaha Nchina nulhupalhe</para>
  <para style="q">nimpwaha machina onkhaye.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Wiira wo nchina na Yesu</para>
  <para style="q">chittu chonkhaye cho wiirimu ni cho velhaponi ni cho unaminepa</para>
  <para style="q">chiwe chaakhoroma wo nthimicho,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>ni kila nlhimi nirumelhelheke wiira</para>
  <para style="q">Yesu Kuristo phi Athithi,</para>
  <para style="q">wo nthimicho wa Nlhuku Athumwanihu.</para>
  <para style="s">Umwalhia thoko nthuko wo velhaponi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Paahi etu ashilhoko aka, thoko chenre inyu wo ukiiwelhelha ikatema chonkhaye, kuhii vaari aka tu, nansho ata vano vahiri aka va, nthepeke unvarelhelha noopo inyu mwoovaka ni uthukumelha, <verse number="13" style="v"/>ukhalhawaya Nlhuku phi nopanga ntheko nhina mwinyu ikatema choothe, mwoorie uttuna ni upanga chinothanana inyu wo utimiriha mathananelho awe oombone.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Paahi etu, mpangacheke kila ittu wo uhitukutuwacha mena uvaanyihana, <verse number="15" style="v"/>wiira nkhalheke attu ahinokhuwachiya mena ahinoothacha. Nkhalheke ashaana omanya a Nlhuku anokhalha ilhapo yo uhilhoka ya attu apotenre, o uwonya. Mwoonieke munlhokoni mwaya thoko ittotwa chinomwalhia wiirimu, <verse number="16" style="v"/>uno nvarecheshaka rata nttenga unowiiha ukumi. Vavawo kinoowa kaapatta nlhatu wo wiishipa nihuku no uwa tho Kuristo nno, ukhalhawaya inowa yoonia wiira akivanre ntheko wo maphathi mena akihunve wo maphathi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ata ukumi aka wakumihiyaka vamoka ni ntheko inyu wo nrima urii isadaka wa Nlhuku, kinootelhiya munrimani chinene ni ukawelhani mwaattiva onkhaye uteelhiya waka uwo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ni inyu mwaatti chiicho nteelhiyeke, tho nteelhiyeke vamoka ni mii.</para>
  <para style="s">Natimotheo ni Naepafrodito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kinokhulhuvelha wa Athithi Yesu waaruma Natimotheo awe uwaninyu uwo chitema, ikhalhe iphiro yo ukihelha nrima vanohalha aka wiiwa mwaha inyu vawo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya akirina ntu nkina o nrima thoko yoyo nochenjeukelhani wo ikekhiaye. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwaani attu akina ayo anochenjeukelhacha mwaha aya ashineneru, wo uhinchenjeukelha Yesu Kuristo. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ni inyu mwaattiva nhaachuwelha Natimotheo chinre aya wo weemelha rata uhimiacha Malhove Orera. Yayo ni mii ninovara ntheko vamoka thoko mwaana na athumwanawe. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Wo chiichammo etu, kinokhulhuvelha waaruma awe uwaninyu chitema, vanottuna aka uchuwelha mwaha unohalha ukikhumelhelha. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ni mii kinorumelhelha wiira Athithi anookooriha uwa uwaninyu chitemaru.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kihoona wiira ihokhalha lazima unruma uwaninyu munnihu Epafrodito, namitheko nanaka munthekoni ni wiinanelhani Malhove Orera, rii karumiya inyu nokikaviha wo chittu chinothanana aka. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya holhakelha chinene uwoonani mwaatti onkhaye, achukulhaka chinene ukhalhawaya thoko mwaheewa wiira aari nreta. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Eiyo, aari nreta aatameriaka uriha ukumi awe, nansho Nlhuku ahomwoonelha ikiriri. Khoonelhiye ikiriri yo vekha aweru, ila ni mii chiicho wiira kihithepe ukelhiya ihuzuni chinene. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Paahi etu, kihomananiha chinene unruma awe uwaninyu, wiira vanottuna inyu umwoona vawo nteelhiyeke mirima ni mii nikithame nipampa nna. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Paahi etu mumpochereke wo nchina na Athithi ni uteelhiya, mmwaalhakelheke thoko ntu munlhokoni mwa attu o ulhohiya rata. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya yoyo ahaatameria ukhwa wo nlhatu wo ntheko wa Kuristo wo uhelha ukumi awe ntatakoni wiira atimirihe ntheko wo ukikavihera mii chittu chahoonrie inyu ukipangelha mwaashinene.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Umanya we ikeekhene mmiholho wa Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Wo umalhihera, ashilhoko aka, nteelhiyeke vanolhutaana inyu ni Athithi. Akinoochaa uhokolheelha ulhepa malhove amanlhe aka ulhepa vatulhi, ukhalhawaya yayo anouthepihani ukhalha rata.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mwiichinanelheke ni attu ari thoko ashipwa ayo, attu anopanga chittu cho uhilhoka, attu anomindelha mwaha wo wiinelhiya unyawo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hii phi attu niinelhiye unyawo we ikekhiaye kahii ayo, ukhalhawaya ninonthimicha Nlhuku wo iphiro yo Iphumu awe ni wiishipa wo ulhutaana ni Kuristo Yesu, nihihelhelhaka mwaha wo wiinelhiya unyawo mwiiruttuni. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Miyaano chiicho kaanooria ukhulhuvelha iruttu aka,</para>
  <para style="p">Akhalhaka haawo ntu nkina nokhulhuvelha iruttu awe, mii phi thepilhe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mii keenelhiye unyawo nihuku no nane toka uyaria waka. Ki Mwiisraeli mii o nikosho ni ashinna Benyamini, Muebraniya nnenene. Vanaachiya mwaha wo uvarechesha Malhehero a ashinna Musa, mii kaari Mfarisayo, <verse number="6" style="v"/>kaakuruvalhelha chinene mpaka nkakaatwarusha milhoko cha attu anonrumelhelha Kuristo. Vanaachiya mwaha wo umanya unopattiya wo uvarechesha Malhehero, kaari o uvarechesha ikekhia wo uhikhuwachiya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nansho wo nlhatu wo unchuwelha Kuristo yayo onkhaye koona aka wiira phi ifaida ayo, phi noona aka vano uhikhalha ittu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Eiyo, wo uthepa vavawo, kinaalhakelha kila ittu uhikhalha ittu wo nlhatu wo urera chinene wo unchuwelha Kuristo Yesu, Athithi. Wo nlhatu waya kihoriha kila ittu koona aka thoko mavi wiira kimpatte Kuristo, <verse number="9" style="v"/>ni ulhutaanihiya ni uyo vamoka. Akinottuna tho wiichalhakelha ikekhiaye inopattiya wo uvarechesha Malhehero a ashinna Musa, nansho ikekhiaye impattiya wo unrumelhelha Kuristo. Ikekhiaye inokhuma wa Nlhuku wo nrima wo unrumelhelha. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kinothanana kinchuwelhe Kuristo ni woona machiri o uhihimmwa wawe, kinkhalhane nlhoko mmoka kinkavihe utwarushiya wawe, kilhikaanihiyaka ni nookhwa awe, <verse number="11" style="v"/>kikhulhuvelhaka wiira ni mii chiicho kinohihimushiya unookhwani.</para>
  <para style="s">Uttimakelha Nttuvo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mena akineera wiira kihophiyelha ama kihorata. Nansho kirii kimananihaka wiira kipatte nttuvo nno. Ukhalhawaya wo nenno nttuvo nno Kuristo Yesu ahokipatta mii. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ashilhoko aka, akinaanyihera wiira kihopatta nenno nttuvo nno nansho kinopanga ittu imoka, ulhiyalha mwaha uvinre ni umananiha upatta alhe arii mmiholho alhe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Paahi etu, kinottimakacha wiira kipochere nttuvo no wiirimu uchulhu no ukumi wo uhimalha nno niihanenlhe awe Nlhuku wo iphiro yo Kuristo Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Paahi etu, hii nikhomanlhe muulhutaanani ni Kuristo va, irusho chihu chuupuwelheke yayo. Nansho ata moopuwelhaka makina, Nlhuku noupatakulhelhani yoyo mwaha uyo. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nansho vavawo vaphiilhe ihu vawo, nkanngwe etu nitwareke ikekhiaye itwarilhe ihu toka machokholhelho mpaka nna iyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ashilhoko aka nkithakiheke mii ni waatwariha rata attu anokhalha wo uttwara iphiro choombone chiuvanheni ihu chiyo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya kahohimeriani ulha mwaha ulha venchi, vano kinohokolhelha uhimeriani tho kimorihaka miithori wiira ahaawo attu enchi ahonvinga nookhwa a Kuristo vansalaabani. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yayo manyaattu ayo anokelha ulhakalha umooroni, ukhalhawaya itama chaya cho mwiiruttuni phi nlhuku aya, anothimicha chittu chinoolhiha muru ni wuupuwelha chittu cho velhaponiru. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nansho hii anenchi o wiirimu, ni ukhuma wowo ninommweherera wo nrima Moopolhi ihu Athithi Yesu Kuristo awe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yayo anowa urukunusha iruttu chihu cho wunta chi chiwe chaalhikaana ni iruttu aya yo nthimicho wo wooria waya unooria weesha chittu chonkhaye mwiikuruni mwaya.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Malhove o uhelhana nrima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Paahi etu ashilhoko aka kinaattuna aka, kinaahuvelha aka chinene woona, mwaatti nnokiteelhiha nrima nri mphumburu aka, mweemelheke rata muulhutaanani ni Athithi, ashilhoko aka kinaattuna aka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ni inyu mwaatti, Naevodia ni Nasuntike kinoupepechani ni ulhepelhani wiira mwaattuneke thoko attu alhutanne wo nrima mmoka, mwi iphiro ya Athithi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ni inyu onnaka o ikekhiaye va, kinouthananani wiira mwaakaviheke yayo manyopani ayo ukhalhawaya ahovara ntheko wo uhimiacha Malhove Orera vamoka ni mii ni ashinna Kelementi ni anamitheko akhunanaka akina onkhaye machina aya alhepiye nhina ikitabu yo ukumi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Paahi etu mwaatti, nteelhiyeke mirima wo ulhutaana ni Athithi, ikatema yonkhaye. Kineera tho, nteelhiyeke mirima. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Umaalha winyu uchuwanieke wa attu onkhaye. Athithi ari vakhiviru uwa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nhikelhiye nipampa no ittu iriyoothe nansho wo kila ittu, munlhapelheke Nlhuku chittu chinothanana inyu ni unshukuru. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ni mpuha wa Nlhuku umpwaha irusho chonkhaye cha attu, unoshungerera rata mirima chinyu ni irusho chinyu wo ulhutaana ni Kuristo Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ashilhoko aka wo umalhihera kineera, nvarechesheke chittu choombone chinothananiya utotopelhiya, nvarechesheke ikeekhene ni mwaha we ikekhiaye, nvarechesheke mwaha uhinanarihiya ni mwaha unorumiha ipilhi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mpangacheke chittu chiittunche inyu ni upochera ukhuma uwannyaka mii, chiiwilhe inyu ni woona kipangachaka. Nlhuku naavaha attu mpuha nookhalha vamoka ni inyu.</para>
  <para style="s">Napaolo anoshukuru izawadi cha attu o Ufilipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kihoteelhiya nrima chinene wo ulhutaana ni Athithi ukhalhawaya irusho chinyu chihokuupuwelha, tho kichuwelhaka we ikekhiaye wiira mwankupuwelha nansho mwaari nhinapatta nipesha. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Akineera chiicho wo nlhatu no uthanana ittu, ukhalhawaya kiheettucha upisha nrima wo kila iphiro inokhalha aka. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kihochuwelha ukhalha ni chittu chinchi ni uhikhalha ni ittu. Kiholhemalhelha upisha nrima vanorupalha aka ama vanowolhiya aka ithalha, vanokhalha aka ni ittu ama vanowukuwelhiya aka. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kinowooria chittu choothe wo iphiro ya Kuristo nokihelha machiri. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nansho mwaattiva mwahopanga ittu yoombone vaari inyu nlhoko mmoka wo uhuva ni mii.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mwaatti attu o Ufilipi va, nhochuwelha rata wiira mahuku aapachera aka uhimiacha Malhove Orera vaakhuma aka Umakedoniya, mwaatti yeekha inyu phi nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo yaakikavinhe. Phi inyu mwaavaranne ni mii upochera ni ukumiha waavaha akina chittu chinohuvelha aya. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya ata vaari aka Uthesalonike mwaatti mwahokiwiihera venchi chittu chaahuvelha aka. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kuhii wiira kinothanana upochera izawadiru, mena, kinothanana woona mahalha inyu o upanga moombone anowunchereria. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Paahi etu, kihopochera chittu chonkhaye chikivanhe inyu chipwahaka ata mahuvelho aka. Vano etu kihanaa kila ittu yaavanhe inyu Naepafrodito wiira akiwiihere. Chittu chikhanlhe thoko isadaka yo nihiriri no unukhelha inorumelhelhiya ni unteelhiha Nlhuku. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Paahi etu, Nlhuku wo nhakhu wawe mwinchi nouvahani chinothanana inyu chonkhaye wo nthimicho wawe mulhupalhe wo iphiro ya Kuristo Yesu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Avahiye nthimicho Nlhuku Athumwanihu, wo mahuku o uhimalha ni uhimalha. Aye.</para>
  <para style="s">Isalamu cho umalhihera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mwaavaheke isalamu chaka attu onkhaye a Nlhuku arii awawe Kuristo Yesu. Ashilhoko ihu anaakhalhana aka vaa ni ayo anouvahani isalamu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye a Nlhuku, anokhalha vaa ayo, athepaka alhe o unupani wa Nakaisari ni ayo anouvahani isalamu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nnema wa Athithi Yesu Kuristo ukhalhe vamoka ni nrima inyu onkhaye.</para>
</usx>
